# Ward—Sacrifice a Food (CR 702.21a, 118.12): Bot2 Lightning Bolts Ygra while controlling two Foods - its Llanowar Elves and
# Elvish Mystic, Foods because of Ygra ("Other creatures are Food artifacts"). Bot2 pays, choosing the Mystic, the second
# offered, so the choice is the payer's and not the first by default. The Mystic goes to the graveyard as a Food, so Ygra's
# trigger puts two +1/+1 counters on it before the Bolt resolves; the Bolt then deals 3 to an 8/8 Ygra.

